                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">British Consulate,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">New Orleans,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-09-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 30, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The above statement, his voluntary act, was signed by the above-named John D.
                    Mirrilees, a person to me known, and worthy of credit, in my presence.<seg
                        type="margin">[<hi rendition="#small-caps">l. s.</hi>]</seg></p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. COPPELL, <hi rendition="#italic">Her Britannic Majesty’s Acting
                            Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
